model walk_notes
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's carried item 7 (issue #108, invented): the G2 review's walk notes: a plan whose day reads a hole prints the hole and books nothing at the run's end (R-27)"

source card "T's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input fee: money PLN

input pay_day: date question "On which day is the fee paid?"

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee

ask w_day_hole: bal(konto, 2026-06-30), bal(konto, 2026-12-31)

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  fee = 40.00 PLN "the card"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
